{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_44","type":"agent_message","text":"The full run passed 103 checks and found three failures. One exposed a real controller bug: rapid D-pad presses could be ignored; that’s fixed. One was a touch-test cleanup error. The third confirmed that WebGPU loses its device after drawing the first frame on this software adapter, and I’m isolating the renderer setting responsible.\n"}}
