{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_65","type":"agent_message","text":"The networking test found the remaining cause: a guest could still have its local attract replay active when joining, which swallowed the first input. Joining now clears attract mode explicitly. I’m also fixing departure handling so a disconnected officer cannot keep taking timer penalties, and the remaining player keeps the correct seat.\n"}}
